"]]]]},{"h":"Often cooked with","links":[["Coconut","ingredient/coconut"],["Rice","ingredient/rice"],["Sugar","ingredient/sugar"]]}]},"dish/lotek-food":{"t":"dish","r":"dish/lotek-food","n":"Lotek (food)","c":"#ede6da","crumb":[["Dishes","dishes"]],"sub":"Dish from Indonesian cuisine","dot":"#f0b340","intro":[["Lotek is a Javanese (Indonesian) vegetable-based salad with peanut sauce. While the sauce ingredients are the same with that of pecel, lotek sauce is typically much sweeter to taste, a nod to a classic \"Matraman\" (adj. belong to the Mataram Sultanate) cuisine."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-lotek-food"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lotek_(food)"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's from","links":[["Indonesian cuisine","cuisine/indonesian-cuisine"]]},{"h":"Ingredients","count":11,"links":[["Bird's eye chili","ingredient/bird-s-eye-chili"],["Chili pepper","ingredient/chili-pepper"],["Garlic","ingredient/garlic"],["Ginger","ingredient/ginger"],["Ipomoea aquatica","ingredient/ipomoea-aquatica"],["Kencur","ingredient/kencur"],["Mung bean sprout","ingredient/mung-bean-sprout"],["Potato","ingredient/potato"],["Shallot","ingredient/shallot"],["Sugar","ingredient/sugar"],["Tamarind","ingredient/tamarind"]]},{"h":"Cook it","rows":[{"name":"Daily Cooking Quest","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"dailycookingquest.com","note":"Indonesian home cook Anita's blog with a large archive of Indonesian recipes.","url":"https://dailycookingquest.com/cuisines/indonesian.html","suggested":true,"kind":"blog"}]},{"h":"More from Indonesian cuisine","links":[["Arem-arem","dish/arem-arem"],["Arsik","dish/arsik"],["Asam pedas","dish/asam-pedas"],["Ayam goreng","dish/ayam-goreng"],["Ayam goreng kalasan","dish/ayam-goreng-kalasan"],["Ayam panggang","dish/ayam-panggang"],["Ayam Taliwang","dish/ayam-taliwang"],["Bajigur","dish/bajigur"],["Bakakak hayam","dish/bakakak-hayam"],["Bakpia","dish/bakpia"],["Bakwan","dish/bakwan"],["Bekasang","d